# ----- Visual-diff / golden-image harness (_visual_diff/) -------------------
# baselines/ + baselines_manifest.json are COMMITTED golden references and must
# stay tracked (the broad *.png rule above would otherwise ignore the baseline
# PNGs, so re-allow them explicitly). current/ + report.* are regenerated on
# every harness run and must NOT be tracked.
!_visual_diff/baselines/
!_visual_diff/baselines/**
!_visual_diff/baselines/*.png
!_visual_diff/baselines_manifest.json
_visual_diff/current/
_visual_diff/report.html
_visual_diff/report.json

